# Translation workflow for zypper-declarative (cli-tool, Go)
# Rendered with pikchr. Records the translator phase order actually followed.
arrow right 200% "Tests First" "(Phase 1)" above
box "independent_tests/" "claude-opus-4-8/" fit
arrow right 200% "Core impl" "(Phase 2)" above
box "internal/* + cmd/" "+ go.mod" fit
arrow right 200% "Packaging" "(Phase 3)" above
box "Makefile, RPM," "debian/*, LICENSE" fit
down
arrow from last box.s down 80% "Docs (Phase 5)" "+ man (Phase 4)" aligned
box "README.md," "man page" fit
arrow left 200% "Compile gate" "(Phase 6)" above
box "go build ./..." "go test (32 pass)" fit
arrow left 200% "Report" "(Phase 7)" above
box "TRANSLATION_" "REPORT.md" fit
